、勝。臧兒長女嫁為金王孫婦，生一女矣，而臧兒卜筮之，曰兩女皆當貴。因欲奇兩女，乃奪金氏。金氏怒，不肯予決，乃內之太子宮。太子幸愛之，生三女一男。男方在身時，王美人夢日入其懷。以告太子，太子曰：「此貴徵也。」未生而孝文帝崩，孝景帝即位，王夫人生男。","source_term":"故燕王臧荼孫"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji049-017","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","ancestor_person_id":"6ks_x4x_dbf","parent_person_id":null,"intermediate_person_ids":[null]},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003130"]},{"id":"lbj_a32_053","label":"兒姁（外戚世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"兒姁","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0009","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0012","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m024-0019"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p019","quote":"兒姁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p019","quote":"兒姁"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m024-0019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p024","quote":"兒姁"}],"id_aliases":["cbr-p003135"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-049","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0009","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0012","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m024-0019"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:p019","c-shiji-049-waiqi:p024"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-049-waiqi"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji049-025","subject_person_id":"lbj_a32_053","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"6ks_x4x_dbf_*A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-0