","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p019","quote":"先是臧兒又入其少女兒姁，兒姁生四男。景帝為太子時，薄太后以薄氏女為妃。及景帝立，立妃曰薄皇后。皇后毋子，毋寵。薄太后崩，廢薄皇后。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p024","quote":"景帝十三男，一男為帝，十二男皆為王。而兒姁早卒，其四子皆為王。王太后長女號日平陽公主，次為南宮公主，次為林慮公主。"}],"rationale":"按明示名、字及各帝后局部親屬敘事暫接；王夫人分景帝皇后與武帝趙妃，代王分文帝與後來少子武。未名者不補姓名，褚氏附載另留原語。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p019","text":"先是臧兒又入其少女兒姁，兒姁生四男。景帝為太子時，薄太后以薄氏女為妃。及景帝立，立妃曰薄皇后。皇后毋子，毋寵。薄太后崩，廢薄皇后。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"臧兒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ks_x4x_dbf_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"兒姁","kind":"person","person_id":"lbj_a32_053","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"兒姁","kind":"person","person_id":"lbj_a32_053","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"r7z_ane_tmt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"薄太后","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"薄氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"r0d_t2p_zgq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"r7z_ane_tmt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"薄皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"r0d_t2p_zgq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"皇后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m019-0055","start":55,"end":58,"sur